      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NIMBLE STAR (6) holding his own in Highway grade and saves his best for the home track. Stalked the speed from the wide gate and never shirked his task with a tough fifth over 1400m at Rosehill in Highway class with the 58kg. Yet to tick the 1400m box, but can get the better of these. FETES DES MERES (2) four runs back have only been average but has a good record over this track and trip. Got right out of his ground from the rails draw with a plugging eighth over 1100m at this track. No shock to see her get the better of these. GREEN RUN (4) motored late from near last on the turn with the 60.5kg to finish seventh over 1300m at Narromine. Expected to take a hand in the finish. NEWS BOUND (8) jumps in trip after holding her ground to the line when fifth over 1300m at Narromine. Maps well with the weight drop and worth thought.",
